<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .banner { background-color: #3b82f6; color: white; padding: 15px 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background-color: #3b82f6; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 15px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="banner">
      <h2 style="margin: 0;">📊 Reminder: Check-in Due Soon</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>You have <strong>{{daysLeft}} days left</strong> to complete your Q{{quarterLabel}} progress update.</p>
      <p>The check-in window closes on <strong>{{windowClose}}</strong>.</p>
      
      <p>Progress: <strong>{{completedGoals}} out of {{totalGoals}} goals</strong> updated so far.</p>
      
      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{appUrl}}/employee/checkins" class="btn">Complete Check-in</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">AtomQuest Goal Tracking Portal</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
